<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="description" content="TRIM — a handmade coffee scale powered by cawfeeOS. A single run of 75 units.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#191919">
<title>TRIM — One run. 75 units.</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#191919;--bg2:#202020;--raise:#2a2a29;--ink:#f5f5f3;--mute:rgba(255,255,255,.62);--dim:rgba(255,255,255,.38);--line:rgba(255,255,255,.14);--accent:#9fc27a;--red:#ff4d3d;--pink:#ff3fa4;--blue:#6b8cff;--orange:#ff9a3c;--max:1120px}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"SF Pro Display","Inter","Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button,input,select{font:inherit}img{display:block;max-width:100%}
.wrap{width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 48px));margin:0 auto}
.mono{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em}
.kicker{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:48px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;border:0;transition:transform .2s ease,background .2s ease,color .2s ease}
.btn:hover{transform:scale(1.03)}.btn:active{transform:scale(.98)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--ink);color:#111}.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.32)}
.btn-ghost:hover{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--ink)}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}
/* nav */
.nav{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;z-index:50;height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:rgba(25,25,25,.72);backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(18px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(18px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.brand{font-weight:800;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--mute)}.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.nav .btn{min-height:34px;padding:0 16px;font-size:13px}
.progress{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-1px;height:1px;background:var(--accent);width:0}
/* scroll scenes */
.scene{position:relative}.sticky{position:sticky;top:0;height:100vh;height:100svh;overflow:hidden}
/* hero */
#hero{height:260vh}
#hero .sticky{display:grid;place-items:center}
.hero-title{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;z-index:2;pointer-events:none}
.hero-title h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(96px,22vw,300px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:.85;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 30%,rgba(255,255,255,.35));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.hero-title p{margin:18px 0 0;font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,24px);color:var(--mute)}
.hero-img{position:absolute;inset:0;will-change:transform,opacity}
.hero-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:40% 55%}
.hero-img:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 45% 55%,transparent 45%,var(--bg) 92%)}
.hero-copy:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-9vh;height:calc(100% + 22vh);background:linear-gradient(0deg,var(--bg) 55%,transparent);z-index:-1}
.hero-copy{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:9vh;text-align:center;z-index:3;opacity:0}
.hero-copy h2{font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,76px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1;margin:0 0 14px}
.hero-copy p{margin:0 auto 26px;color:var(--mute);max-width:560px;padding:0 24px}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.scroll-hint{position:absolute;bottom:28px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;z-index:3}
.scroll-hint:after{content:"";display:block;width:1px;height:28px;margin:10px auto 0;background:linear-gradient(var(--dim),transparent);animation:hint 1.8s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes hint{0%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:top}50%{transform:scaleY(1);transform-origin:top}51%{transform-origin:bottom}100%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:bottom}}
/* word reveal */
#manifesto{height:220vh}
#manifesto .sticky{display:grid;place-items:center}
.reveal-text{font-size:clamp(34px,5.2vw,68px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.08;max-width:980px;padding:0 24px;margin:0}
.reveal-text span{opacity:.14;transition:opacity .15s linear}
.reveal-text .hl{color:var(--accent)}
/* brew scene */
#brew{height:520vh}
#brew .sticky{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;align-items:center;gap:56px;width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 48px));margin:0 auto;overflow:visible}
.steps{position:relative;height:340px}
.step{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);transition:opacity .5s ease,transform .5s ease}
.step.on{opacity:1;transform:none}
.step h2{font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,64px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:14px 0 18px;font-weight:700}
.step p{color:var(--mute);margin:0;max-width:430px;font-size:18px}
.step-dots{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:28px}.step-dots i{width:28px;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--line);overflow:hidden;position:relative}.step-dots i b{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--ink);transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(0)}
.device{position:relative;border-radius:28px;padding:18px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#e9e9e6,#bdbdb8);box-shadow:0 40px 120px rgba(0,0,0,.55),inset 0 1px 0 #fff}
.device:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:6px;border-radius:23px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08);pointer-events:none}
.lcd{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:12px;background:radial-gradient(120% 100% at 30% 0%,#1b2033,#0b0d16 70%);overflow:hidden;border:3px solid #111;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Inter",sans-serif}
.lcd .w{position:absolute;left:6%;top:6%;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,44px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#fff;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.lcd .t{position:absolute;right:6%;top:6.5%;font-size:clamp(20px,2.8vw,34px);font-weight:700;color:var(--pink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.lcd .r{position:absolute;left:6.4%;top:19%;font-size:clamp(12px,1.4vw,16px);font-weight:600;color:var(--blue);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.lcd .f{position:absolute;left:6%;bottom:5%;font-size:clamp(12px,1.5vw,17px);font-weight:700;color:#6ee07a;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.lcd .state{position:absolute;left:50%;top:7%;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap}
.lcd svg{position:absolute;left:4%;right:4%;top:28%;width:92%;height:60%;overflow:visible}
.lcd .axis{stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.12);stroke-width:1}
.lcd .lbl{fill:rgba(255,255,255,.45);font-size:11px}
.lcd .curve{fill:none;stroke:var(--orange);stroke-width:3.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(255,154,60,.55))}
.lcd .killline{stroke:var(--red);stroke-width:3;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s}
.lcd .killtxt{fill:var(--red);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s}
.lcd .target{stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.28);stroke-dasharray:4 5}
.saved{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;background:rgba(8,10,18,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);opacity:0;transition:opacity .4s}
.saved.on{opacity:1}
.saved div{text-align:center;color:#fff}.saved b{display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);letter-spacing:-.02em}.saved span{display:block;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:14px;margin-top:6px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
/* editions */
#editions{height:420vh}
#editions .sticky{display:flex;align-items:center}
.ed-stage{position:absolute;top:56px;bottom:0;right:0;left:34%}
.ed-img{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transition:opacity .8s ease,transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);transform:scale(1.06)}
.ed-img.on{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}
.ed-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}
.ed-img:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--bg) 0%,transparent 22%,transparent 85%,var(--bg)),linear-gradient(0deg,var(--bg),transparent 18%,transparent 82%,var(--bg))}
.ed-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 48px));margin:0 auto}
.ed-head{font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,64px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1;margin:14px 0 36px}
.ed-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;max-width:420px}
.ed-item{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 0;opacity:.38;transition:opacity .4s}
.ed-item:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.ed-item.on{opacity:1}
.ed-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px}
.ed-name{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.ed-price{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.ed-meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);margin-top:2px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.ed-desc{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;color:var(--mute);font-size:15px;transition:max-height .5s ease,margin .5s ease}
.ed-item.on .ed-desc{max-height:80px;margin-top:10px}
/* 75 */
#seventyfive{height:300vh}
#seventyfive .sticky{display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center}
.big75{font-size:clamp(160px,34vw,420px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.08em;line-height:.8;margin:0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,rgba(255,255,255,.25));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.sub75{font-size:clamp(20px,2.6vw,30px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:26px auto 8px;max-width:720px;padding:0 24px}
.sub75 span{color:var(--mute)}
.units{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(25,1fr);gap:7px;width:min(620px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:36px auto 0}
.units i{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;transform:scale(0);transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.3,1.6,.5,1)}
.units i.on{transform:scale(1)}
.units .c1{background:#f2f2ee}.units .c2{background:#4a4a48;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.35)}.units .c3{background:transparent;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(190,225,255,.8)}
.legend{display:flex;gap:22px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mute)}
.legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.legend i{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}
/* bento */
.section{padding:140px 0}
.section-title{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,80px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1;margin:14px 0 18px}
.section-lede{color:var(--mute);font-size:20px;max-width:620px;margin:0 0 56px}
.bento{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:16px}
.tile{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:24px;padding:32px;min-height:260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.tile h3{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.15}.tile p{margin:0;color:var(--mute);font-size:15px}
.tile .num{font-size:clamp(56px,6vw,84px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:.9;margin-bottom:auto;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,rgba(255,255,255,.4));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.tile .num small{font-size:.4em;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.t-a{grid-column:span 4}.t-b{grid-column:span 2}.t-c{grid-column:span 2}.t-d{grid-column:span 2}.t-e{grid-column:span 2}.t-f{grid-column:span 3}.t-g{grid-column:span 3}
.tile.photo{padding:0;min-height:360px}.tile.photo img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:75% 50%}
.tile.photo .cap{position:relative;padding:96px 32px 32px;background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(24,24,24,.98) 45%,transparent);margin-top:auto}
.stages{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:auto}.stages i{flex:1;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(159,194,122,.9) var(--h),rgba(255,255,255,.06) var(--h))}
.fade-up{opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px);transition:opacity .9s ease,transform .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.fade-up.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
/* reserve */
.reserve{padding:140px 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#111 60%)}
.reserve-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:72px;align-items:start}
.card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:24px;padding:28px}
.seg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:22px}
.seg button{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 10px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;min-height:44px;transition:border-color .2s,background .2s}
.seg button b{display:block;font-size:16px}.seg button span{font-size:12px;color:var(--mute)}
.seg button[aria-checked="true"]{border-color:var(--ink);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
.field{margin-bottom:14px}.field label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute);margin-bottom:6px}
.field input{width:100%;min-height:48px;background:#151515;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:0 14px;color:var(--ink)}
.field input:focus{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);outline:none}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.qty{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;height:48px;overflow:hidden}
.qty button{width:48px;height:48px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:20px}.qty output{font-weight:700}
.total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:10px;padding:20px 0}
.total strong{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.total span{color:var(--mute)}
.card .btn{width:100%}
.fine{font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);margin:12px 0 0}.error{display:none;color:#ff8a7a;font-size:14px;margin-top:10px}.error.show{display:block}
.remain{margin-top:28px;display:grid;gap:14px}
.remain div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr 60px;gap:14px;align-items:center;font-size:14px}
.bar{height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--line);overflow:hidden}.bar b{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--ink);transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(0);transition:transform 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.in .bar b{transform:scaleX(var(--s))}
.remain em{font-style:normal;color:var(--mute);text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
/* faq */
.faq{padding:120px 0}.faq-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:72px}
.faq h2{font-size:48px;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1;margin:0}
details{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 0}details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;min-height:60px;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;gap:20px}
summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}summary:after{content:"+";font-size:26px;font-weight:300;color:var(--mute);transition:transform .3s}details[open] summary:after{transform:rotate(45deg)}
details p{color:var(--mute);margin:0 0 20px;max-width:640px}
footer{padding:48px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:var(--dim);font-size:13px}
footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.modal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:80;background:rgba(0,0,0,.7);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);display:none;place-items:center;padding:20px}.modal.open{display:grid}
.modal-card{width:min(500px,100%);background:#222;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:30px}
.modal-card h3{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 10px}.modal-card p{color:var(--mute);margin:0}
.summary{background:#161616;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;margin:18px 0;font:13px/1.6 ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--ink)}
.modal-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end}
@media(max-width:860px){
 .nav-links a:not(.btn){display:none}
 .hero-img img{object-fit:contain;object-position:50% 40%;transform:scale(1.9);-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 30%,#000 36%,#000 44%,transparent 51%);mask-image:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 30%,#000 36%,#000 44%,transparent 51%)}
 #brew .sticky{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;align-content:center;padding-top:64px}
 #brew .device{order:-1;width:min(460px,100%);margin:0 auto;padding:12px;border-radius:22px}
 .steps{height:210px}.step h2{font-size:34px;margin:8px 0 10px}.step p{font-size:16px}.step-dots{margin-top:16px}
 .ed-stage{left:0;height:44%;bottom:auto}
 #editions .sticky{align-items:flex-end;padding-bottom:6vh}
 .ed-head{margin-bottom:18px}.ed-name{font-size:22px}.ed-item{padding:12px 0}
 .bento{grid-template-columns:1fr}.t-a,.t-b,.t-c,.t-d,.t-e,.t-f,.t-g{grid-column:auto}.tile{min-height:220px}
 .reserve-grid,.faq-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
 .section,.reserve{padding:96px 0}
 .units{gap:5px}
}
@media(max-width:480px){.wrap{width:calc(100% - 32px)}.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.seg{grid-template-columns:1fr}.seg button{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.modal-actions{flex-direction:column}.hero-copy{bottom:7vh}.units{grid-template-columns:repeat(15,1fr)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="nav"><div class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="#hero" aria-label="TRIM home">TRIM</a><nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary"><a href="#brew">Espresso</a><a href="#editions">Editions</a><a href="#more">Features</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#reserve">Pre-order</a></nav></div><div class="progress" id="progress"></div></header>
<main>
<section class="scene" id="hero" aria-label="Introduction">
 <div class="sticky">
  <div class="hero-img" id="heroImg"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="TRIM coffee scale in white, with its display set into a clear acrylic surround"></div>
  <div class="hero-title" id="heroTitle"><div><h1>TRIM</h1><p>A coffee scale, built by hand.</p></div></div>
  <div class="hero-copy" id="heroCopy"><h2>Trust the first drop.</h2><p>Solid 0.0 g. Live flow. A stop cue that knows when to cut the shot. Handmade in a single run of 75.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#reserve">Pre-order</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#brew">Watch a shot</a></div></div>
  <div class="scroll-hint" id="hint">Scroll</div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="scene" id="manifesto" aria-label="About the founding run">
 <div class="sticky"><p class="reveal-text" id="reveal">Every TRIM is assembled, calibrated and finished by hand. That takes time, so there will only ever be <span class="hl">75</span> of this first run. When they are gone, they are gone.</p></div>
</section>

<section class="scene" id="brew" aria-label="Espresso mode walkthrough">
 <div class="sticky">
  <div>
   <div class="steps">
    <div class="step on" data-i="0"><div class="kicker">Espresso mode</div><h2>Ready.<br>Rock-solid zero.</h2><p>Put the cup down and TRIM tares itself. Pump vibration is averaged out, so the screen sits at a calm 0.0 g.</p></div>
    <div class="step" data-i="1"><div class="kicker">First drop</div><h2>Brewing starts.<br>So does the timer.</h2><p>The timer starts on its own when real espresso lands in the cup. No buttons.</p></div>
    <div class="step" data-i="2"><div class="kicker">Predictive stop cue</div><h2>Never miss<br>the mark.</h2><p>A red line reads your live flow and the drip that follows, and marks the moment to cut the pump so you land on your yield.</p></div>
    <div class="step" data-i="3"><div class="kicker">Memory</div><h2>Brew. Done.<br>Saved.</h2><p>Yield, time, ratio and the full graph are saved on the scale. Up to 100 espresso shots, no app required.</p></div>
   </div>
   <div class="step-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i><i><b></b></i></div>
  </div>
  <div class="device" aria-hidden="true">
   <div class="lcd">
    <div class="w" id="lw">0.0 g</div><div class="state" id="lstate">Ready</div><div class="t" id="lt">00:00</div><div class="r" id="lr">1:0.0 x</div><div class="f" id="lf">0.0 g/s</div>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 500 220" preserveAspectRatio="none">
     <line class="axis" x1="30" y1="200" x2="500" y2="200"/><line class="axis" x1="30" y1="0" x2="30" y2="200"/>
     <line class="target" x1="30" x2="500" id="ltarget"/>
     <text class="lbl" x="0" y="204">0</text><text class="lbl" x="0" y="104">20</text><text class="lbl" x="0" y="8">40</text>
     <text class="lbl" x="178" y="218">10s</text><text class="lbl" x="335" y="218">20s</text><text class="lbl" x="470" y="218">30s</text>
     <path class="curve" id="lcurve" d="M30 200"/>
     <circle id="ldot" r="5.5" fill="#fff" cx="30" cy="200"/>
     <line class="killline" id="lkill" y1="0" y2="200"/>
     <text class="killtxt" id="lkilltxt" y="-8" text-anchor="middle">STOP</text>
    </svg>
    <div class="saved" id="lsaved"><div><b>Shot saved</b><span id="lsum">36.0 g · 29 s · 1:2.0</span></div></div>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
