<section class="faq" id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-grid">
 <h2 class="fade-up">Before you<br>pre-order.</h2>
 <div class="fade-up">
  <details><summary>How limited is the founding run?</summary><p>TRIM is built by hand, not mass-produced. This run is capped at 75 units: 35 Cirrus, 25 Carbon and 15 Canopy.</p></details>
